  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All On- A1 Power Solar Home Systems Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is SOLAR COOLING SOLUTIONS AND SOLAR HOME SYSTEM primarily in conjunction with the Lagos State Fishermen Cooperative . The cooling solution is to be sited in Magbon/Orimedu Community of Ibeju Lekki LGA of Lagos State. The community is a significant fishing hub in the area where about 400 male fishermen and about 600 female seafood produce traders regularly congregate to transact business. The focal problem is significant post-harvest losses primarily due to the absence of proper cold storage which remains a serious gap for many fishing communities. The solution shall provide access to energy for both domestic and productive use, reduce the wastage and cost of doing business for agricultural producers, processors, and sellers.</narrative>
  </description>
